<!--
  The development stack only (../../compose.yaml); deployments never load it.
  It loads after config.d/ottertrail.xml and replaces one setting.

  ClickHouse takes its share of the memory that is free while it runs:
  its own plus what the system has available, times this ratio, worked
  out again as other processes grow and shrink. Podman's machine is small
  (2 GB by default) and shared with other containers, so 40% leaves
  ClickHouse about 350 MiB, nearly all of it its own idle use, and tests
  running side by side fail for lack of memory. 75% leaves room for them,
  and still a quarter of what is free for everything else.
-->
<clickhouse>
    <max_server_memory_usage_to_ram_ratio>0.75</max_server_memory_usage_to_ram_ratio>
</clickhouse>
